<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani money market closed on bank holiday.</title>
<headline>Pakistani money market closed on bank holiday.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-01-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Pakistani money market was closed on Wednesday for a bank holiday, money dealers said.</p>
<p>The market will reopen on Thursday. The overnight call money rate closed at 23.00 percent on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192.</p>
</text>
